window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-024-a67c3f475dfd96ca.json"]={sha256:"a67c3f475dfd96cab8afffdaad1b23a49f379cdf6fac286545a1064f663fc171",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-77ec1880d235c9b1","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-1-and-Switch-Ports/Quality-of-Service/","title":"Quality of Service","titleEn":"Quality of Service","publisher":"NVIDIA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-024","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-024","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-025","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/linux-rdma/rdma-core"],"title":"RDMA SEND：接收 credit 與完成事件契約","titleEn":"RDMA SEND: receive credits and completion contracts","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付依賴圖、循環成員、移除邊前後結果，以及活性與完整性分開的驗收紀錄；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the dependency graph, cycle membership, before-and-after edge results and separate liveness and integrity acceptance records. Keep the offline model distinct from any instruction to alter a running switch. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 message_id、posted_receive、completion 與 app_consumed 事件；用不同狀態欄位保存，禁止單一 done 旗標。","differenceEn":"Build events for message identity, posted receive, completion and application consumption. Preserve distinct states instead of one done flag, and require unique ownership of every receive buffer.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["教學圖中只有位於有向循環的佇列算循環阻塞；暴露位元組為這些佇列的已排隊量總和；三個佇列 A→B→C→A，各排隊 64 KiB；變更移除 C→A，並假設末端能排空；名義式 3*64 = 192 KiB in cycles；變更式 0*64 = 0 KiB in cycles。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","在無新補充且每訊息消耗一個接收 credit 的模型中，缺口為 max(0,待發訊息數－可用 credit)；待發 120 則；可用接收 credit 名義 96、變更 128；訊息大小均符合每個接收 buffer；名義式 max(0,120-96) = 24 receive credits missing；變更式 max(0,120-128) = 0 receive credits missing。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["In the teaching graph, only queues belonging to a directed cycle count as cyclically blocked. Exposed bytes are the queued bytes in those cycle members, not all traffic anywhere in the fabric. Start with A waiting for B, B for C and C for A, each holding 64 KiB. Remove C’s dependency on A and assume the terminal service can drain; all other queue sizes remain the initial snapshot. Nominal 3*64 = 192 KiB in cycles; changed 0*64 = 0 KiB in cycles. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","With no replenishment and one receive credit consumed per message, deficit is the positive difference between queued sends and available receive credits. This deliberately simplified model is not a full verbs state machine. Queue 120 messages. Available receive credits change from 96 to 128, and every message fits its receive buffer. No credits are replenished during the modeled burst. Nominal max(0,120-96) = 24 receive credits missing; changed max(0,120-128) = 0 receive credits missing. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-034","referenceUrls":["https://docs.daos.io/master/overview/transaction/"],"title":"DAOS snapshots：保留視圖與版本回收界線","titleEn":"DAOS snapshots: retained views and version-reclamation boundaries","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付依賴圖、循環成員、移除邊前後結果，以及活性與完整性分開的驗收紀錄；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the dependency graph, cycle membership, before-and-after edge results and separate liveness and integrity acceptance records. Keep the offline model distinct from any instruction to alter a running switch. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 key、epoch、version_id、size 表與保留視圖集合；輸出 view_to_version、unique_versions 和候選回收三表。","differenceEn":"Build key, epoch, version identity and size records plus the retained-view set. Emit view-to-version mappings, unique referenced versions and candidate reclamation lists as separately reviewable artifacts.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["教學圖中只有位於有向循環的佇列算循環阻塞；暴露位元組為這些佇列的已排隊量總和；三個佇列 A→B→C→A，各排隊 64 KiB；變更移除 C→A，並假設末端能排空；名義式 3*64 = 192 KiB in cycles；變更式 0*64 = 0 KiB in cycles。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","每個保留視圖對每個鍵選不晚於 epoch 的最新版本，再對版本識別碼取聯集計容量；沒有引用的版本才是此模型候選；單鍵三版本：epoch 1 為 4 MiB、epoch 2 為 8、epoch 3 為 4；名義保留快照 1、2 與最新 3，變更移除快照 1；名義式 4+8+4 = 16 MiB referenced；變更式 8+4 = 12 MiB referenced。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["In the teaching graph, only queues belonging to a directed cycle count as cyclically blocked. Exposed bytes are the queued bytes in those cycle members, not all traffic anywhere in the fabric. Start with A waiting for B, B for C and C for A, each holding 64 KiB. Remove C’s dependency on A and assume the terminal service can drain; all other queue sizes remain the initial snapshot. Nominal 3*64 = 192 KiB in cycles; changed 0*64 = 0 KiB in cycles. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","For each retained view and key, select the latest version not newer than its epoch. Sum the union of referenced version identities; unreferenced versions are reclamation candidates only within this simplified model. One key has versions of 4 MiB at epoch 1, 8 MiB at epoch 2 and 4 MiB at epoch 3. Retain snapshots 1 and 2 plus latest view 3, then remove snapshot 1 only. Nominal 4+8+4 = 16 MiB referenced; changed 8+4 = 12 MiB referenced. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-7d2d2923d453ec72","url":"https://github.com/linux-rdma/rdma-core","title":"rdma-core verbs interfaces","titleEn":"rdma-core verbs interfaces","publisher":"linux-rdma project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-c359e652f7fedc4a","url":"https://docs.daos.io/master/overview/transaction/","title":"DAOS transaction model","titleEn":"DAOS transaction model","publisher":"DAOS project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
